   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "src/core/element-store.ts · src/core/board-seed.ts · src/core/board-state.ts\none Map per workspace, created on first use, and watched so every change is saved.\nAn unknown id yields an empty store, never another board's. Read from the last save\nor the board file; written beside the registry — and copied there before a clear.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "src/core/element-store.ts · src/core/board-seed.ts · src/core/board-state.ts\none Map per workspace, created on first use, and watched so every change is saved.\nAn unknown id yields an empty store, never another board's. Read from the last save\nor the board file; written beside the registry — and copied there before a clear.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
