   "text": "customData.kind = \"board-section\"\n\nThe mark a hotkey aims at.\nThe shape carries the title and\nthe key, so the board declares\nits own navigation.\nIts key, and Alt+B and Alt+T,\nreach the board even while the\nterminal has the keyboard; the\nshell is not sent them.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind = \"board-section\"\n\nThe mark a hotkey aims at.\nThe shape carries the title and\nthe key, so the board declares\nits own navigation.\nIts key, and Alt+B and Alt+T,\nreach the board even while the\nterminal has the keyboard; the\nshell is not sent them.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
