   "text": "src/core/agent-backend.ts · agent-adapter.ts\nagents/{claude-code,codex-cli,raw}.ts · implement-worktree.ts\nimplement-queue.ts · implement-state.ts · implement-recovery.ts · github-pull.ts\nimplement-agent.ts · implement-landing.ts · implement-reclaim.ts\nA board names its backend and the binary comes off PATH; the backend writes the\nargv, the posture and the stream flags. raw is a command line, run as given. An\nissue becomes a run in a git worktree of its own, <project>-worktrees/issue-<n>,\non a branch of the same name. Four at once; a slot takes the oldest card whose\ndependencies have closed, and an interrupted run is offered for resume. The pull\nrequest decides the record: done means it merged, blocked means the agent\nstopped for a person, and a run that ends without one is finished by a second\nagent, once. A slot held by a run that is over is given back, with the reason.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "src/core/agent-backend.ts · agent-adapter.ts\nagents/{claude-code,codex-cli,raw}.ts · implement-worktree.ts\nimplement-queue.ts · implement-state.ts · implement-recovery.ts · github-pull.ts\nimplement-agent.ts · implement-landing.ts · implement-reclaim.ts\nA board names its backend and the binary comes off PATH; the backend writes the\nargv, the posture and the stream flags. raw is a command line, run as given. An\nissue becomes a run in a git worktree of its own, <project>-worktrees/issue-<n>,\non a branch of the same name. Four at once; a slot takes the oldest card whose\ndependencies have closed, and an interrupted run is offered for resume. The pull\nrequest decides the record: done means it merged, blocked means the agent\nstopped for a person, and a run that ends without one is finished by a second\nagent, once. A slot held by a run that is over is given back, with the reason.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
