   "text": "docs/running.md\n\nnpm run build, then node dist/server.js.\nIt takes a free port and prints it; kill\na stale one first. Every EXCALIDRAW_*\nvariable is optional; github.com is not.\n\nIts tables are generated from\nsrc/core/settings.ts.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "docs/running.md\n\nnpm run build, then node dist/server.js.\nIt takes a free port and prints it; kill\na stale one first. Every EXCALIDRAW_*\nvariable is optional; github.com is not.\n\nIts tables are generated from\nsrc/core/settings.ts.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
