   "text": "customData.kind =\n\"board-subsection\"\n\nThe parts of a section, and\nAlt+← / Alt+→ between them.\nA step never leaves the\nsection it started in.\nDrawn, not declared: the\nsection that encloses it says\nso. None drawn, no key bound.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "customData.kind =\n\"board-subsection\"\n\nThe parts of a section, and\nAlt+← / Alt+→ between them.\nA step never leaves the\nsection it started in.\nDrawn, not declared: the\nsection that encloses it says\nso. None drawn, no key bound.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
